# Density Compare
# Tantalum (Ta) — real density 16.69 g/cm³. equal masses: Tantalum vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Tantalum Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.8mm color: #a0c8c8 at (-20mm, 3.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 133.1 g — the water cube is the reference
